{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3b04cf3d9fd9d5b2fff48d183e335de096c5c5ab0f2131daa72babb2cc71bea4", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のロケに来ている。\n可奈の撮影は順調に進み、早めに休憩に入った）", "zh": "（正在为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》进行外景拍摄。\n可奈的拍摄顺利进行，提前进入了休息时间）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e1e72e244b9ae123e9858a94289244daf0bf596840f8d8a6b8dd661db178005", "ja": "わあ、湖キレイ～！　それにおっきくて……はれ？\n今はねたのって……おーいお魚さん、出ておいで～♪", "zh": "哇，湖水好漂亮～！而且好大……咦？\n刚才跳起来的是……喂～小鱼，快出来呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f369fb71ecbc490a895318a86a4c90a8bfe5760da4ff9ec9432b7a9abef92adc", "ja": "可奈、お疲れ様。\nなんだか上機嫌だな。", "zh": "可奈，辛苦了。\n感觉你心情特别好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "4b61c20624ec85a6fb485e5b5503cc041f7fcce112937e53512a42b2f963099c", "ja": "はい！　外で歌うのって、やっぱり気持ちいいですね。\n空気もおいしくて、最高の気分です！", "zh": "是的！在外面唱歌果然很舒服呢。\n空气也很清新，心情棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "1b40ac036d0bfa3b72e39eeac1b92491bec7f008c2b95c4bd8cf2a854e8b45ed", "ja": "でもでも、一番最高なのは、この衣装です！\n真っ白だし、ヒラヒラしてて、とってもかわいいです！", "zh": "不过不过，最棒的还是这套服装！\n洁白无瑕，又轻飘飘的，特别可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a132cea582bdfddfe595c7779d6f6c32378a5c6cfb14dceb3a47894d601d350", "ja": "それに私、気づいたんです……。お日様の下だと、\n衣装がキラキラするって！　ほらほら、キラキラ～♪", "zh": "而且我还发现了……在阳光下，服装会闪闪发光！你看你看，闪闪发亮～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2cf03230292691b15a174e61ed453f03adc30ca8c226d4ed3b6fa2ee34f0fb53", "ja": "おお、本当だ！　自然の中にいるからか、\nなんだか幻想的だな。まるで妖精みたいだ。", "zh": "哦，真的耶！是因为身处大自然中吗，总觉得有种梦幻的感觉。简直就像仙女一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "676c4c1d8cb62db1b9d6e37298c3de9c5dac0a3ea4afc40ead435a26a10aa41b", "ja": "よ、妖精さんですか！？　妖精さん……えへへ♪\nそれなら、妖精さんみたいに歌わないと……。", "zh": "小、小妖精吗！？小妖精……嘿嘿♪\n既然这样，那就得唱得像个小妖精才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "faec29e04b2613dfdef94bc32f3f7ebd7e27e839e5acdf49eee81686fc4308c0", "ja": "はれっ？　あの、{$P$}さん……\n妖精さんって、どんな風に歌うか知ってますか？", "zh": "咦？那个，{$P$}先生……  \n你知道妖精会怎么唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b37a26850f25320b041be0fc59f0bad1ce019a17d2058c8dd4363869c7053cb5", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そうだな……。妖精はイタズラ好きと\nいうからな。幻想的な感じ、かな？", "zh": "诶！？这、这个嘛……听说妖精喜欢恶作剧。应该是很梦幻的感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "25f3946034db2290d7ea66e279119547094518b6aa5c3542990afd8b50881986", "ja": "わあ～、{$P$}さん物知りですね！\nそっか。幻想的か……こほん！", "zh": "哇～，{$P$}先生真是博学呢！\n这样啊。幻想的感觉吗……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "58fcfb38a0c6c9a73181effd23ebd0cf36a8dfa97f7844a3ce36db84acaf3057", "ja": "今日の可奈は、妖精さん～♪\n私はどこにいるかな～♪　探してみよ～、そうしよ～♪", "zh": "今天的可奈，是小精灵～♪  \n我在哪里呢～♪ 找找看吧～，就这么办吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d6dc48cca9f3ee8b6248033baef26c0b2984a001ec3fcd0898dd3ebb049df4b5", "ja": "幻想的だったかはわからないけど……\nいつもと違う雰囲気で、すごいよかったよ！", "zh": "虽然不知道算不算得上梦幻……\n但和平时的氛围不一样，非常棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "f0670dd71a0bcf7b1ad2362ef8a7cc4956d52038a577217067dec88789b90aed", "ja": "やったー♪　ここで妖精さんとかくれんぼしたら、\n楽しそうだなって気持ちを歌ってみたんです！", "zh": "太好啦～♪ 我是试着把“要是能在这里和妖精捉迷藏，\n肯定很有意思吧”的心情唱出来了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "d51cb8cae056cdaab22a7549e130e77916fe00bb8eda430fb202a19cdfbf9912", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}さん！\n私とかくれんぼしませんか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生！\n要不要和我一起玩捉迷藏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4106abeb7900590f69e4104df5005ae072ec8e46cfc6d1c3b72cadfe42c3bed2", "ja": "えっ、今からか？　時間は……まだ大丈夫そうだな。\nよし、やってみるか！", "zh": "诶，现在就要开始吗？时间……好像还来得及。\n好，那就试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "10387d05ccdb6afc53aca16dd91efd0905cc5c77af1d7ea93c1e284071dac253", "ja": "わーい！　それじゃあ早速、隠れてきまーす！\nヒントは私の歌声です。必ず見つけてくださいね～♪", "zh": "太好啦！那我马上就去藏起来啦～！\n提示是我的歌声哦。一定要找到我呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0353_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2c97eac085808e323a6542b363a737bab3472f7cf28060bc674c4cfee468838a", "ja": "（こうして休憩時間は、あっという間に終わった。\nいつの間にこんな時間に……これも妖精の仕業かな？）", "zh": "（就这样，休息时间转眼间就结束了。\n什么时候变得这么晚了……这也是妖精搞的鬼吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
